The packed C=128 no-mask path is too close to the tolerance under leaderboard recheck seeds. I’m moving it to an intermediate variant: keep the one packed BF16 projection, but compute the input layer norm in FP32 before converting to BF16. That should recover some accuracy while preserving most of the speedup.
