codex
The N=256 safe branch can use the intermediate FP32-layernorm packed path too; that was robust in earlier runs and is faster than the original two-projection C=128 path. I’ll use that for N=256 and N=1024, leaving N=512/N=768 on the fastest BF16 packed path.
